# Third-party licenses

The `vex` binary includes the components below. This file is generated by
[cargo-about](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about) from `about.toml`
and `about.hbs`; regenerate it when dependencies change:

```sh
cargo about generate -m crates/vex-cli/Cargo.toml about.hbs -o THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md
```

## Components outside crates.io

| Component | License | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| [ONNX Runtime](https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime) 1.28 | MIT | Statically linked through `ort`. License and its own third-party notices: [licenses/onnxruntime/](licenses/onnxruntime/) |
| [sqlite-vec](https://github.com/asg017/sqlite-vec) 0.1.9 | MIT OR Apache-2.0 | Vendored C source: [crates/vex-store/vendor/sqlite-vec/](crates/vex-store/vendor/sqlite-vec/) |
| [tree-sitter-hcl](https://github.com/tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-hcl) 1.2.0 | Apache-2.0 | Vendored parser: [crates/vex-extract/vendor/tree-sitter-hcl/](crates/vex-extract/vendor/tree-sitter-hcl/) |
| [SQLite](https://sqlite.org) | Public domain | Bundled by `libsqlite3-sys` |

The embedding model ([BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5](https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5),
MIT; quantized ONNX export by [Qdrant](https://huggingface.co/Qdrant/bge-small-en-v1.5-onnx-Q))
is not shipped; vex downloads it on first use.

